{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stones known as &quot;Skill Gems&quot; have fallen from the sky all over the world. Equipping these gems grants powerful attack abilities. People scramble to find Skill Gems to survive, and some even see them as a chance to dominate the world. The battle is about to begin!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Form a Battle Team</strong>: Command brave warriors, equip them with powerful Skill Gems, and make them unstoppable on the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Strategy</strong>: Assign Skill Gems in a simple and intuitive way to plan skill deployment strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrilling Combat</strong>: Take direct control of warriors in intense battles or delegate control to the AI and focus on tactical planning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Challenges</strong>: Explore diverse levels, collect more Skill Gems, and take on increasingly powerful enemies, including formidable bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena Mode</strong>: Compete against other players in fierce arenas where wisdom and strength collide, fighting for glory and generous rewards.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3323440?t=1771847425","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3323440?t=1771847425","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323440/88b4e0821e46238f55d75e26f9e9da3866a2bb1f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771847425","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323440/88b4e0821e46238f55d75e26f9e9da3866a2bb1f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771847425","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"S